objective_template:
Iteration {{iteration_number}} - {{iteration_title}}

Subject entity: {{subject_entity}}
Counterparty entity: {{counterparty_entity}}
Setting / context: {{setting_context}}
Timeline anchor: {{timeline_anchor}}

Prior operator decision: {{operator_choice}}

Deliver the N canonical artifacts for this iteration. The N is set per-project in the agent manifest; a default list is:
  1. primary deliverable (.md / .docx / .pdf)
  2. structured data export (.json / .csv / .parquet)
  3. visual or diagram (.svg / .png / .html)
  4. supporting analysis (.md / .ipynb)
  5. test / verification artifact (.ps1 / .py / .sh)
  6. audit + decisions log (.json)
  7. continuity / consistency report (.json)

Preserve all prior-iteration continuity from the {{subject_entity}} contract and the {{setting_context}} world model. Pay attention to the timeline anchor: every section must reference where in the lifecycle this iteration sits.

If this is iteration 1, write the {{subject_entity}} and {{counterparty_entity}} contracts from scratch in canonical format. If iteration 2+, read decision_history.json and carry every prior operator decision forward.

Gate 2 (CRITICAL - operator checkpoint) MUST surface explicitly. The operator will be asked whether to deepen the constraint at the midpoint. The {{counterparty_entity}} may or may not learn about the {{subject_entity}}'s status - this is the operator's call, not the engine's.
